{"obsah":"<p>A demanding first exhibition after injury for Vlasta, and also for the other riders, who had to cope with the extreme heat at the event in picturesque Řasnice. We were a bit surprised by an almost hour-long traffic jam on the way to Liberec, which delayed other performers at the event too.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>The locals were already in full swing when we arrived, and the mayor welcomed us in full gear. On the gravel surface we had a carpet ready to ride on. Lukáš Valný, Vlasta and young guns Márty, Elli and Nikol launched into the exhibition, which entertained the spectators hiding in the tent, and several of them didn't mind playing living obstacles in the sun.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Thanks for the invitation and the encouragement.</p>\n\n<p></p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F08%2FIMG_4486.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F08%2FIMG_4486.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-238058\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F08%2FIMG_4487.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F08%2FIMG_4487.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-238057\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F08%2FIMG_4488.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F08%2FIMG_4488.webp?alt=media\" al